    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_0963857c",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image shows a man with a frost-covered beard and face, suggesting he is in extremely cold weather. The text reads: 'note to self. if she is a squirter wait till it warms up outside.' The meme uses the visual of extreme cold to humorously imply a delay in sexual activity until conditions improve. The term 'squirter' is a vulgar slang term for someone who ejaculates prematurely during sex. The overall intent is to create a crude, sexually suggestive joke using the metaphor of waiting for weather to warm up as a reason to delay sexual activity. This meme contains misogynistic content by objectifying and degrading women based on their sexual performance, and it uses vulgar language to mock female sexuality. The intent is to provoke laughter through crude humor, but it does so at the expense of women's dignity and sexual autonomy, fitting under the 'Mysogynous' toxicity category.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_6eea930b"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
