      "label": "User projected onto the man in the image as 'self'",
      "description": "The text overlay 'note to self' explicitly projects the user (viewer) onto the man depicted in the image, identifying him as the 'self' making the note. This creates a direct analogical mapping where the visual entity 'man' is understood as the speaker or subject of the note, allowing the user to identify with or imagine themselves as this person. The projection is explicit through the deictic 'self' in the text, which anchors the user's perspective onto the visual material of the man.",
